completed_at: "2026-10-23T11:12:38.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Pin the mutation coordinate to 42 and replace it with its XOR inverse; reverting only the changed write-byte expression must fail the existing unstaged-change assertion. Production staging, safety bounds and coverage thresholds remain unchanged."
parent: pm-vcs-phase6stage
repro_steps: "The streaming staging regression writes literal byte 42 at random offset 400. With probability 1/256 the byte is already 42, so the operation is a no-op and the unstaged-change assertion fails even when staging is correct. Observed on Node 22 in PR 144 CI run 39919162579; the same test passed in the first full gate and in isolation."
resolution: "The CDC regression writes the XOR inverse at coordinate 42, guaranteeing real mutation; reverting only that expression fails the unchanged unstaged-change assertion."
expected_result: "Pin the mutation coordinate to 42 and replace it with its XOR inverse; reverting only the changed write-byte expression must fail the existing unstaged-change assertion. Production staging, safety bounds and coverage thresholds remain unchanged."
